{"parentUuid":"53945bab-b1ed-4e54-ba2a-8643c2f1d2f5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"70d9dafa-1f14-4678-b8ce-ac74f472bc00","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N1tSswWeBzVscpimL7WqPR","type":"tool_result","content":"## 5. Repo layout\n\n```\nMakefile                 setup, keys, temporal, worker, smoke, ingest, eval, db-init, db-verify, api, web, app, test, lint, numbers\npyproject.toml           one uv project, Python pinned in .python-version\npaperghosts/             the Python package\n  config.py              reads .env; never prints a value\n  schemas/               Pydantic models (single source of truth)\n  ingest/                streaming reader, lexicon, prefilter, samples\n  reader/                prompts, Tinker training and sampling, local runner, quote verifier\n  geo/                   GeoNames loader, LCCN title parser, geocoder\n  cluster/               reprint clustering, embeddings\n  store/                 Atlas loader, indexes, validators, static export\n  investigator/          agent loop, tools, guardrails\n  workflows/             Temporal workflows, activities, worker\n  observability/         Sentry setup and model-call spans\napi/                     FastAPI app (read-only)\nweb/                     React + Vite + TypeScript site and design system\neval/\n  gold/                  split, hash, labelling policy (committed)\n  results/               JSON and charts for evals A to D (committed)\nscripts/                 one-off checks: keys, crop check, offline proof, numbers sheet\ntests/                   unit, integration (Temporal test env), API contract\ndata/                    local only, gitignored except small manifests and per-year counts\nDocs/                    BRIEF, ARCHITECTURE, PRD, SRS, BUILD-PLAN, DECISIONS, RESUME, UI-IDEAS (IDEAS.md stays private)\n.github/workflows/       CI\nrender.yaml              deploy blueprint (used only after the owner's yes)\n```\n\n## 6. Environments and delivery\n----\ndependencies = [\n    \"fastapi>=0.162.0\",\n    \"httpx>=0.28.1\",\n    \"orjson>=3.13.0\",\n    \"pymongo>=4.19.0\",\n    \"sentry-sdk>=2.73.0\",\n    \"temporalio>=1.35.0\",\n    \"tinker>=0.36.0\",\n    \"uvicorn>=0.54.0\",\n    \"zstandard>=0.25.0\",\n]\n[dependency-groups]\ndev = [\n    \"pytest>=9.2.0\",\n    \"ruff>=0.17.3\",\n]\neval/:\ngold\nresults\n\neval/results:\nphase1\nphase1_env.json\nphase2a\n----\ncounts keys: ['year', 'lexicon_version', 'pages', 'articles', 'candidates', 'near_miss', 'by_term', 'only_by_term', 'by_state'] | by_state sample: [('Arkansas', {'pages': 196, 'articles': 6454, 'candidates': 27}), ('Connecticut', {'pages': 144, 'articles': 3791, 'candidates': 18})] | None-state key present: []\nsample keys: ['article_id', 'bbox_list', 'date', 'headline', 'lccn', 'member', 'near_miss_terms', 'paper', 'sample', 'scan', 'state', 'text'] | first: random | keys of a near-miss row: ['article_id', 'bbox_list', 'date', 'headline', 'lccn', 'member', 'near_miss_terms', 'paper', 'sample', 'scan', 'state', 'text']\n5:import random\n11:from paperghosts.ingest.lexicon import ghost_terms, near_miss_terms\n52:    random_sample = Reservoir(sample_size, random.Random(f\"{year} random\"))\n53:    near_miss_sample = Reservoir(sample_size, random.Random(f\"{year} near-miss\"))\n54:    result = {\"pages\": 0, \"articles\": 0, \"near_miss\": 0, \"candidates\": []}\n75:            near = near_miss_terms(text)\n76:            item = record(member, page, article, near_miss_terms=near)\n77:            random_sample.offer(item)\n79:                result[\"near_miss\"] += 1\n80:                near_miss_sample.offer(item)\n85:        \"random\": random_sample.items,\n86:        \"near_miss\": near_miss_sample.items,\nREADME\nconnectives\npropernames\nweb2\nweb2a\nwords\n  235976 /usr/share/dict/words","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"204f6356-f387-4e1f-b7fc-fa2a54073d3c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:13:42.258Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## 5. Repo layout\n\n`