{"parentUuid":"17a6daa4-db70-4693-8302-5d9904d3b63f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"759d921c-3445-4d20-bf6c-64bf23bda927","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MwyhWbDyBjGe6Z3aUByW6n","type":"tool_result","content":"80:### 2B: schemas and data layer\n81-**Persona:** data architect.\n82-- Pydantic models, with Atlas validators generated from them.\n83-- `make db-init` creates every collection and index, and can be re-run safely.\n84-- A storage budget built from real document sizes, and a written decision on what goes into Atlas.\n85-- The GeoNames geocoder and its manifest. The LCCN title parser, tested on at least 200 distinct titles.\n86-- The reprint-clustering design, and its evaluation set.\n87-\n88-**Gate**\n89-- Schema tests pass, and `make db-init` can run twice.\n90-- The budget is written down.\n91-- Geocoder accuracy is measured on a sample.\n92-\n93-### 2C: the reader\n94-**Persona:** ML specialist.\n51e970c docs: add planning docs, decisions 6-12 and repo config","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ad2fbb75-57d6-410c-b856-0f51bc447c91","timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:10:14.733Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"80:### 2B: schemas and data layer\n81-**Persona:** data architect.\n82-- Pydantic models, with Atlas validators generated from them.\n83-- `make db-init` creates every collection and index, and can be re-run safely.\n84-- A storage budget built from real document sizes, and a written decision on what goes into Atlas.\n85-- The GeoNames geocoder and its manifest. The LCCN title parser, tested on at least 200 distinct titles.\n86-- The reprint-clustering design, and its evaluation set.\n87-\n88-**Gate**\n89-- Schema tests pass, and `make db-init` can run twice.\n90-- The budget is written down.\n91-- Geocoder accuracy is measured on a sample.\n92-\n93-### 2C: the reader\n94-**Persona:** ML specialist.\n51e970c docs: add planning docs, decisions 6-12 and repo config","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected