{"parentUuid":"936cf471-03b4-4e3f-8929-d10e5a777457","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYb9w8FuozqGs15xAJZi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2A.7: DONE. PR #2 is open into `main`: https://github.com/Hotragn/Paperghosts/pull/2 (`1426fd8`, `36e20e3`).\n\n- **Screen:** 1,284 of the 38,600 new articles hold a flag word or near-miss term. Eight reading agents judged them. I re-judged 127 of their negatives, picked by seed, and agreed on all 127. I also re-read all 10 close calls and reports in full.\n- **Found:** 4 reports, 2 of them borderline. All four are spiritualist, and \"spirit\" is their only near-miss word.\n- **Estimate:** about 38,000 reports among non-candidates (14,800–97,600). So lexicon v1 finds about 49% of the reports, and at least 27%. The near-miss pool has 4 in 1,013.\n- **Caveat:** with their lexicon terms masked, only 5 of eval A's 7 reports would still hit the screen, so it may miss some reports.\n- **Lexicon v2, your call:** spiritualist terms would add about 161,000 candidates and catch 3 of the 4 reports. It needs a full re-read: 118.6 min, 340.4 GB.\n\nThe STATUS block and the plan items are written. I haven't seen CI's result yet. Details are in `step-2A.7.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3716,"cache_read_input_tokens":388367,"output_tokens":444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3716,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":388367,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3716,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3716},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_trans