{"parentUuid":"b90c96f7-29cc-4278-a88b-5bfb384488f1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"10e32944-f26c-4e52-a7ee-6e5ea350bb2b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011SeHYDagqLEMsezbvuSEn6","type":"tool_result","content":"       0\n   82391e3..5ac2e1b  main       -> origin/main\n5ac2e1b Merge pull request #2 from Hotragn/phase-2a-archive\nbranch 'phase-2a-lexicon-v2' set up to track 'origin/main'.\n5ac2e1b Merge pull request #2 from Hotragn/phase-2a-archive\n.PHONY: setup lint test web keys temporal worker smoke api app ingest eval db-init db-verify numbers\n\nsetup:\n\tuv sync --locked\n\tpnpm --dir web install --frozen-lockfile\n\nlint:\n\tuv run ruff check .\n\tuv run ruff format --check .\n\tpnpm --dir web lint\n\tpnpm --dir web exec tsc -b\n\ntest:\n\tuv run pytest\n\nweb:\n\tpnpm --dir web dev\n\nkeys:\n\tuv run python scripts/check_keys.py\n\ntemporal:\n\tmkdir -p data/temporal\n\ttemporal server start-dev --db-filename data/temporal/temporal.db\n\nworker:\n\tuv run python -m paperghosts.workflows.worker\n\nsmoke:\n\tuv run python -m paperghosts.workflows.smoke\n\ningest:\n\tuv run python -m paperghosts.workflows.ingest $(YEARS)\n\n# eval A over the archive read: eval/results/eval_a.json and the charts in eval/results/eval_a/\neval:\n\tuv run python scripts/eval_a.py\n\napi:\n\tuv run uvicorn api.main:app --port 8000\n\n# the API and the web shell together\napp:\n\t$(MAKE) -j2 api web\n\n# Later targets fail on purpose until their phase builds them.\ndb-init:\n\t@echo \"make $@ is built in Phase 2B\"; exit 1\n\ndb-verify:\n\t@echo \"make $@ is built in Phase 2D\"; exit 1\n\nnumbers:\n\t@echo \"make $@ is built in Phase 5A\"; exit 1","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4e3fd978-9c4c-42c1-b350-a4afca7447c9","timestamp":"2026-10-30T14:43:07.316Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"       0\n   82391e3..5ac2e1b  main       -> origin/main\n5ac2e1b Merge pull request #2 from Hotragn/phase-2a-archive\nbranch 'phase-2a-lexicon-v2' set up to track 'orig