{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","hash":"7d7c83fe866704b683ea63f001822ba65e3805fdf859c007294b67edfe1adda1","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Next, the plan: 2B gets v2's reel-map counts, and 2C gets the policy items, eval B's independent recall and the reader's job size."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014h8BC7FQM1vd9V9Vhz6rRE","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"  - Build it from the batch paths in the candidates and samples, so a page with no batch path gets its IIIF service from local data. That's about 310,000 candidates.","new_string":"  - Build it from the batch paths in the candidates and samples, so a page with no batch path gets its IIIF service from local data. That's about 367,000 of lexicon v2's candidates (decision 31)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Lvd8njsjb23oKJmHW3gyyt","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"- No loc.gov lookups yet for the 25,595 candidates whose reels the map doesn't cover. At 20 a minute they would take about a day, and most won't be reports.","new_string":"- No loc.gov lookups yet for the 27,817 candidates whose reels the map doesn't cover. At 20 a minute they would take about a day, and most won't be reports."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JHjJAB29avKrmBtunAtG7N","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"   - It also settles claims of spirit control and of a felt presence of the dead. Decision 30 counts two such articles as borderline reports, and they are half of the reports it found.","new_string":"   - It also settles claims of spirit control and of a felt presence of the dead. Decision 30 counts two such articles as borderline reports, and they are half of the reports it found.\n   - And decision 31's two borderline kinds: a claim inside a narrative whose truth is doubtful, and a particular claim told inside a general essay. It confirms or overrules counting a first-person claim of communication with a named dead person, made in a lecture or an interview."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CNWfjLuKeuANxdDWHkdn8U","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"   - Eval B also has the reader screen the random reservoirs, for a recall bound that doesn't rest on flag words (decision 30). The Tinker credit check sets how many it reads.","new_string":"   - Eval B also has the reader screen the random reservoirs, for a recall bound that doesn't rest on flag words (decision 30). The Tinker credit check sets how many it reads.\n   - That screen gives lexicon v2's independent recall. Decision 31's 84% is in-sample."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SuiJ2RmBH5UKHv1R6W4Q9U","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"10. The full pass over all triaged candidates.","new_string":"10. The full pass over all triaged candidates.\n   - Lexicon v2 makes the reader's job 1,236,122 candidates, 17.7% more than v1's (decision 31). The Tinker credit check weighs that before the pass starts."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
