*Recall, in-sample: 84%, and at least 48%.** v1's screen of 38,900 articles was read again with v2. v2 catches 3 of its 4 reports, and 1 in 38,883 is still missed, about 9,500 articles. v2's rules were chosen from those misses, so this figure is optimistic. 2C's eval B gives the independent one.\n6. **Eval A's EDA charts are regenerated on v2.** There are six, in `eval/results/eval_a_v2/`, and I rendered and checked each in light and dark.\n7. **Close-out:**\n   - decision 31\n   - the Phase 2A STATUS block in `RESUME.md`, with v2's numbers and the in-sample caveat\n   - v2's numbers in the 2B and 2C plan items: the reader's job grows to 1,236,122 candidates (+17.7%), and 27,817 candidates need loc.gov\n\n## Commits\n\n- `72ef622` lexicon v2 and its tests\n- `ca57e25` eval A on either lexicon, and `scripts/lexicon_v2.py`\n- `0101271` the counts and manifests of the re-read, v2's EDA, `lexicon_v2.json` and `added.json`\n- `7c928e8` decision 31, the STATUS block and the plan items\n\n## Checks\n\n- `make test`: 176 passed. `make lint`: exit 0.\n- Each commit's staged diff was scanned for `.env` values, with none found and no machine name.\n- No loc.gov requests, and nothing spent.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head phase-2a-lexicon-v2 --title \"Phase 2A.8: lexicon v2\" --body-file $S/pr-body.md 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"","description":"Open the lexicon v2 pull request into main"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"a1caea29-650d-4949-bb21-f6d406ea85bd","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgYo4amuBQ3UMMyymQPUh","requestRef":"abbefb88-f285-4b8f-867a-126d3d0a493d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fdd10209-4760-45c6-aa6f-37ca6663935a","timestamp":"2026-10-30T17:12:43.194Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts"