{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","hash":"53866ab63235b48e283393ad9c7bba2256a7abd522b6a856f687f86d9fd72839","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Step 0 first: the EM's keep-all-five call goes into decision 31, the STATUS block and the 2C plan item."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AjMb8Cf2NdfgSvBFS2xFYS","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md","old_string":"  - `lexicon_v2.json` gives each rule's `marginal` (over the 200) and `only` (over its sampled articles holding only it).","new_string":"  - `lexicon_v2.json` gives each rule's `marginal` (over the 200) and `only` (over its sampled articles holding only it).\n- **The EM's call (2026-10-30): keep all five rules.**\n  - Each of spiritualism, seance, spirit_phrase and spirit+medium catches reports that no other rule does.\n  - ouija's 0 of 6 rules nothing out (0–39%), and it costs only 5,124 candidates, 0.4% of the reader's job. 2C's term strata measure it."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01S2oPbBmEPfEMzVeM4C2XYH","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/RESUME.md","old_string":"**Phase 2B: schemas and data layer** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), once PR #3 (lexicon v2) is merged. The EM keeps or drops each new rule from its marginal yield (decision 31). Dropping one takes a filter on `terms`, not a re-read.","new_string":"**Phase 2B: schemas and data layer** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), on branch `phase-2b-data-layer`. Step 2B.1 covers the models, `make db-init` and the storage budget. Step 2B.2, the geocoder and LCCN parser, follows once the EM has reviewed it. Lexicon v2 keeps all five rules (decision 31)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017zdyeBQCdUwfL5ASad2fHe","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/RESUME.md","old_string":"- **The ouija rule is flagged** (decision 31): none of its 6 sampled candidates is a report (0–39%). Dropping it is the EM's call, and a filter on `terms` would remove 5,124 candidates.\n- Each new rule's marginal yield rests on 0 to 4 reports, so its interval is wide (decision 31).","new_string":"- **The ouija rule stays.** None of its 6 sampled candidates is a report (0–39%). The EM kept it, and 2C's term strata measure it (decision 31).\n- Each new rule's marginal yield rests on 0 to 4 reports, so its interval is wide (decision 31)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HLPcf1djXAHLhiMVZ57JTF","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"1. Write `POLICY.md`, build the gold set, freeze it and hash it.","new_string":"1. Write `POLICY.md`, build the gold set, freeze it and hash it.\n   - The gold set's term strata include each of lexicon v2's five rules. That's how ouija, kept with 0 reports in its 6 sampled candidates, gets measured (decision 31)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
