{"parentUuid":"e916dd88-bd47-4ca5-9d6d-44ed5e8b6461","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[{"name":"WebSearch","description":"Search the web. Returns result blocks with titles and URLs. US-only.\n\n- The current month is (provided in the conversation below) — use this when searching for recent information.\n- `allowed_domains` / `blocked_domains` filter results.\n- After answering from results, end with a \"Sources:\" list of the URLs you used as markdown links.","input_schema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","type":"object","properties":{"query":{"description":"The search query to use","type":"string","minLength":2},"allowed_domains":{"description":"Only include search results from these domains","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"blocked_domains":{"description":"Never include search results from these domains","type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"mode":{"description":"\"standard\": the normal web search: quick and cheap; right for straightforward lookups (reference facts, official pages, documentation, well-known people, places and topics) and simple follow-up lookups. \"extended\": a thorough, fresh search at several times the cost and latency.","type":"string","enum":["standard","extended"]}},"required":["query","mode"],"additionalProperties":false},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6dcffc2b-6cd6-4411-be9b-257f276a48ea","timestamp":"2026-10-30T17:37:22.007Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"6dcffc2b-6cd6-4411-be9b-257f276a48ea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYpy6CYKwirL5wR3tuX8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011MeSD8KJjpy9JoGZyihqZW","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"MongoDB Atlas M0 free cluster storage limit 512 MB dataSize indexSize how storage is calculated","mode":"standard","allowed_domains":["mongodb.com"]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":958,"cache_read_input_tokens":446310,"output_tokens":145,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":958,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":145,"cache_read_input_tokens":446310,"cache_creation_input_tokens":958,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":958},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_011MeSD8KJjpy9JoGZyihqZW":{"query":"MongoDB Atlas M0 free cluster storage limit 512 MB dataSize indexSize how storage is calculated","mode":"standard","allowed_domains":["mongodb.com"]}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b08440d7-8590-4f88-923e-0da2bc8efd3f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgYpy4ycgf6EpLqTZW7R7","requestRef":"65be08a0-be21-4426-bef3-313856e2381e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bbad8876-3450-4e93-a8c8-c88be3739273","timestamp":"2026-10-30T17:37:22.006Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"bbad8876-3450-4e93-a8c8-c88be3739273","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cfc7125e-bacb-48e4-917e-c396bc7253de","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011MeSD8KJjpy9JoGZyihqZW","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"MongoDB Atlas M0 free cluster storage limit 512 MB dataSize indexSize how storage is calculated\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Pricing\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"MongoDb M0 Cluster limits clarifications - MongoDB Atlas - MongoDB Community Hub\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/t/mongodb-m0-cluster-limits-clarifications/124122\"},{\"title\":\"Atlas Ephemeral Clusters\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/products/tools/atlas-ephemeral-clusters\"},{\"title\":\"Request limit in the free tier - MongoDB Atlas - MongoDB Community Hub\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/t/request-limit-in-the-free-tier/9804\"},{\"title\":\"Create an Atlas Ephemeral Cluster - Atlas - MongoDB Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/create-ephemeral-cluster/\"},{\"title\":\"Free Your Genius With MongoDB Atlas Free Tier\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/product-release-announcements/free-your-genius-on-mongodb-atlas-free-tier\"},{\"title\":\"MongoDB Atlas Setup: Complete Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/resources/products/platform/atlas-setup-guide\"},{\"title\":\"AWS MongoDB Pricing\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/products/platform/atlas-cloud-providers/aws/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing Pay-As-You-Go MongoDB Atlas On Azure Marketplace\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/news/introducing-pay-as-you-go-atlas-azure-marketplace\"},{\"title\":\"Manage Clusters - Atlas - MongoDB Docs\",\"url\":\"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/manage-clusters/\"}]\n\nThe official docs define M0 storage as data size plus index size, capped at 512 MB. The search didn't turn up an official explanation of how `dataSize` and `indexSize` are measured on disk, such as whether compression is counted.\n\n- **Cap and what counts:** Atlas's cluster comparison table lists free-cluster storage as Storage (Data Size + Index Size) 512 MB. The ephemeral-cluster docs word the same limit as Storage: Maximum of 512 MB, including indexes.\n- **Compression:** A Community Hub answer says it's hard to predict how your data will be compressed on disk and it depends on docs structure and data types, and that mostly text or number documents may compress by up to 3–5 times. This is a forum reply, not official documentation.\n- **Capacity example:** The same forum thread gives a worked example: at about 500 bytes per document, I can save about 512 Mb (4096000000 bytes) / 500 bytes = 8,192,000 Documents before I max out my M0 tier. The 4096000000 figure there is 512 MB expressed in bits, not bytes, so the document count is off by a factor of 8. The correct figure is roughly 1 million documents at 500 bytes each (512 MiB ÷ 500 B ≈ 1.07 million).\n- **Hitting the limit:** A forum user reports that if you try to insert more, you will get an error. The write operation will fail. That is a community reading, and it's from an older thread, so verify it against current docs before relying on it. The same thread says the limit is not a monthly limit. It's an absolute limit.\n- **Other limits:** Free clusters are also limited to up to 100 operations per second, and Connections: Maximum of 500 concurrent connections.\n\nSources: MongoDB Atlas docs (Manage Clusters, Create an Ephemeral Cluster), MongoDB pricing page, and MongoDB Community Hub threads (the M0 limits clarification and the request-limit thread, both several years old).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"63adde61-2f09-4c4a-9d26-a2caec72a82d","timestamp":"2026-10-30T17:37:29.867Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"MongoDB Atlas M0 free cluster storage limit 512 MB dataSize indexSize how storage is calculated","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01AiGFNiNdAqJWVSeVX391Qi","content":[{"title":"Pricing","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/pricing"},{"title":"MongoDb M0 Cluster limits clarifications - MongoDB Atlas - MongoDB Community Hub","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/t/mongodb-m0-cluster-limits-clarifications/124122"},{"title":"Atlas Ephemeral Clusters","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/products/tools/atlas-ephemeral-clusters"},{"title":"Request limit in the free tier - MongoDB Atlas - MongoDB Community Hub","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/t/request-limit-in-the-free-tier/9804"},{"title":"Create an Atlas Ephemeral Cluster - Atlas - MongoDB Docs","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/create-ephemeral-cluster/"},{"title":"Free Your Genius With MongoDB Atlas Free Tier","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/product-release-announcements/free-your-genius-on-mongodb-atlas-free-tier"},{"title":"MongoDB Atlas Setup: Complete Guide","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/resources/products/platform/atlas-setup-guide"},{"title":"AWS MongoDB Pricing","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/products/platform/atlas-cloud-providers/aws/pricing"},{"title":"Introducing Pay-As-You-Go MongoDB Atlas On Azure Marketplace","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/news/introducing-pay-as-you-go-atlas-azure-marketplace"},{"title":"Manage Clusters - Atlas - MongoDB Docs","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/manage-clusters/"}]},"The official docs define M0 storage as data size plus index size, capped at 512 MB. The search didn't turn up an official explanation of how `dataSize` and `indexSize` are measured on disk, such as whether compression is counted.\n\n- **Cap and what counts:** Atlas's cluster comparison table lists free-cluster storage as Storage (Data Size + Index Size) 512 MB. The ephemeral-cluster docs word the same limit as Storage: Maximum of 512 MB, including indexes.\n- **Compression:** A Community Hub answer says it's hard to predict how your data will be compressed on disk and it depends on docs structure and data types, and that mostly text or number documents may compress by up to 3–5 times. This is a forum reply, not official documentation.\n- **Capacity example:** The same forum thread gives a worked example: at about 500 bytes per document, I can save about 512 Mb (4096000000 bytes) / 500 bytes = 8,192,000 Documents before I max out my M0 tier. The 4096000000 figure there is 512 MB expressed in bits, not bytes, so the document count is off by a factor of 8. The correct figure is roughly 1 million documents at 500 bytes each (512 MiB ÷ 500 B ≈ 1.07 million).\n- **Hitting the limit:** A forum user reports that if you try to insert more, you will get an error. The write operation will fail. That is a community reading, and it's from an older thread, so verify it against current docs before relying on it. The same thread says the limit is not a monthly limit. It's an absolute limit.\n- **Other limits:** Free clusters are also limited to up to 100 operations per second, and Connections: Maximum of 500 concurrent connections.\n\nSources: MongoDB Atlas docs (Manage Clusters, Create an Ephemeral Cluster), MongoDB pricing page, and MongoDB Community Hub threads (the M0 limits clarification and the request-limit thread, both several years old)."],"durationSeconds":6.930225166998803,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"b08440d7-8590-4f88-923e-0da2bc8efd3f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bbad8876-3450-4e93-a8c8-c88be3739273","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
