 outcome, kind, place type, precision, decade and state."," - `reports`:","   - a 2dsphere index on `location`","   - compound `{place_id, date}` and `{month_day}`","-  - an Atlas Search index on headline, text, field values and town, used with fuzzy matching","-  - a Vector Search index on `embedding`, with filters on state and decade","-- `places`: 2dsphere, plus Atlas Search autocomplete on names","-- `cases`: `{report_id}`","-","-**Storage budget:** if the cluster is the free tier (512 MB), only stories, places, cases and stats go to Atlas. Candidates and reader outputs stay local, and the article says so. The real per-document size is measured in Phase 2B before anything is loaded.","+  - a partial unique index on `case_id`, which holds only the 30–60 investigated stories","+  - Atlas Search `reports_search`, a static mapping (rule 5) used with fuzzy matching:","+    - headline, display headline, text, town and the reader fields' values, as strings","+    - state, and the reader's outcome, place type and precision, as tokens","+    - decade, as a number","+    - no printings and no quotes","+  - Vector Search `reports_vector` on `embedding` (384 dimensions, cosine), with filters on state and decade","+- `places`:","+  - 2dsphere on `location`","+  - Atlas Search autocomplete `places_search` on name and alternate names, with state as a token","+- `cases`: unique `{report_id}`","+","+M0 allows three Search indexes in the whole cluster, and the plan uses all three. `sample_mflix.movies` holds one (`default`), so `places_search` waits on the owner (decision 33).","+","+**Storage budget:**","+- M0 counts data size plus index size against its 512 MB.","+- Candidates and reader outputs stay local, and the article says so.","+- `BUDGET.md` has the measured bytes per story and how many stories fit (decision 33)."," "," ## 5. Repo layout"," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md"]}},