{"parentUuid":"3b5d64d8-fe53-467b-b10b-0c7555932113","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYroYXmA5zsmDmRSWdyP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014VM2EghnAjhDnQAT3t6Bnj","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"  - Validate it: hide the batch on pages that have one, and count how often the map gets it back.\n  - Flag every reel that maps to more than one batch, such as a reissued ver01 and ver02.","new_string":"  - Validate it: hide the batch on pages that have one, and count how often the map gets it back.\n  - Flag every reel that maps to more than one batch, such as a reissued ver01 and ver02.\n  - Check a page located without a batch path before its crop is shown, and measure the check's error in the validation. One way is the scan's height and width against the IIIF `info.json`, and another is its OCR.\n    - The check is needed because a member name can point at the wrong page. Where a candidate has both, its member's frame differs from its batch path's in 2.5% of them, and its reel in 396 (decision 33).\n    - The batch path wins wherever it exists."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1939,"cache_read_input_tokens":592720,"output_tokens":769,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1939,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":769,"cache_read_input_tokens":592720,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1939,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1939},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_014VM2EghnAjhDnQAT3t6Bnj":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"  - Validate it: hide the batch on pages that have one, and count how often the map gets it back.\n  - Flag every reel that maps to more than one batch, such as a reissued ver01 and ver02.","new_string":"  - Validate it: hide the batch on pages that have one, and count how often the map gets it back.\n  - Flag every reel that maps to more than one batch, such as a reissued ver01 and ver02.\n  - Check a page located without a batch path before its crop is shown, and measure the check's error in the validation. One way is the scan's height and width against the IIIF `info.json`, and another is its OCR.\n    - The check is needed because a member name can point at the wrong page. Where a candidate has both, its member's frame differs from its batch path's in 2.5% of them, and its reel in 396 (decision 33).\n    - The batch path wins wherever it exists."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"29b0b971-533f-40f8-8906-f650ab61b8fd","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgYroXYVALZc1P7HryNpw","requestRef":"01e1a981-86c4-4296-a464-43351af83cc9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b384d5b-3e7b-44bb-9230-00ddd97d3faa","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:01:28.293Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"3b384d5b-3e7b-44bb-9230-00ddd97d3faa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYroYXmA5zsmDmRSWdyP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01T8F8Fjjjuc6GBkMpKr5xr6","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"- Geocode, cluster, embed, and load Atlas.\n- `make db-verify` runs geo, fuzzy and vector queries and checks their expected results and latencies.","new_string":"- Geocode, cluster, embed, and load Atlas.\n  - Before choosing int8 embeddings over float32, measure their neighbours against float32's on real embeddings. Decision 33's check used synthetic vectors.\n  - The places autocomplete index, `places_search`, needs a free Search slot (decision 33). `make db-init` creates it once there is one.\n- `make db-verify` runs geo, fuzzy and vector queries and checks their expected results and latencies."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1939,"cache_read_input_tokens":592720,"output_tokens":769,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1939,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":769,"cache_read_input_tokens":592720,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1939,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1939},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01T8F8Fjjjuc6GBkMpKr5xr6":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","old_string":"- Geocode, cluster, embed, and load Atlas.\n- `make db-verify` runs geo, fuzzy and vector queries and checks their expected results and latencies.","new_string":"- Geocode, cluster, embed, and load Atlas.\n  - Before choosing int8 embeddings over float32, measure their neighbours against float32's on real embeddings. Decision 33's check used synthetic vectors.\n  - The places autocomplete index, `places_search`, needs a free Search slot (decision 33). `make db-init` creates it once there is one.\n- `make db-verify` runs geo, fuzzy and vector queries and checks their expected results and latencies."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"29b0b971-533f-40f8-8906-f650ab61b8fd","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgYroXYVALZc1P7HryNpw","requestRef":"01e1a981-86c4-4296-a464-43351af83cc9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"311f71fc-6c36-4de7-9d90-340d6c57123d","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:01:30.894Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"3b384d5b-3e7b-44bb-9230-00ddd97d3faa","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d9847e6d-1ff5-4ddf-ae83-97f1a4dc7124","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014VM2EghnAjhDnQAT3t6Bnj","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"cbf0d344-300a-4263-9150-c0f90c8f0d8a","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:01:30.918Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","oldString":"  - Validate it: hide the batch on pages that have one, and count how often the map gets it back.\n  - Flag every reel that maps to more than one batch, such as a reissued ver01 and ver02.","newString":"  - Validate it: hide the batch on pages that have one, and count how often the map gets it back.\n  - Flag every reel that maps to more than one batch, such as a reissued ver01 and ver02.\n  - Check a page located without a batch path before its crop is shown, and measure the check's error in the validation. One way is the scan's height and width against the IIIF `info.json`, and another is its OCR.\n    - The check is needed because a member name can point at the wrong page. Where a candidate has both, its member's frame differs from its batch path's in 2.5% of them, and its reel in 396 (decision 33).\n    - The batch path wins wherever it exists.","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":90,"oldLines":6,"newStart":90,"newLines":9,"lines":["   - Build it from the batch paths in the candidates and samples, so a page with no batch path gets its IIIF service from local data. That's about 367,000 of lexicon v2's candidates (decision 31).","   - Validate it: hide the batch on pages that have one, and count how often the map gets it back.","   - Flag every reel that maps to more than one batch, such as a reissued ver01 and ver02.","+  - Check a page located without a batch path before its crop is shown, and measure the check's error in the validation. One way is the scan's height and width against the IIIF `info.json`, and another is its OCR.","+    - The check is needed because a member name can point at the wrong page. Where a candidate has both, its member's frame differs from its batch path's in 2.5% of them, and its reel in 396 (decision 33).","+    - The batch path wins wherever it exists."," - No loc.gov lookups yet for the 27,817 candidates whose reels the map doesn't cover. At 20 a minute they would take about a day, and most won't be reports.","   - Resolve only the ones the reader makes reports, through `crops.get` at one request every 3.5 s.","   - Cache each answer, which `page_service` doesn't do yet, so no page is looked up twice."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3b384d5b-3e7b-44bb-9230-00ddd97d3faa","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"311f71fc-6c36-4de7-9d90-340d6c57123d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d9847e6d-1ff5-4ddf-ae83-97f1a4dc7124","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T8F8Fjjjuc6GBkMpKr5xr6","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"10691678-545f-49f7-9e3d-e149d66ef3ed","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:01:30.960Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","oldString":"- Geocode, cluster, embed, and load Atlas.\n- `make db-verify` runs geo, fuzzy and vector queries and checks their expected results and latencies.","newString":"- Geocode, cluster, embed, and load Atlas.\n  - Before choosing int8 embeddings over float32, measure their neighbours against float32's on real embeddings. Decision 33's check used synthetic vectors.\n  - The places autocomplete index, `places_search`, needs a free Search slot (decision 33). `make db-init` creates it once there is one.\n- `make db-verify` runs geo, fuzzy and vector queries and checks their expected results and latencies.","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":133,"oldLines":6,"newStart":133,"newLines":8,"lines":[" ### 2D: load, cluster and harvest"," **Persona:** data engineer."," - Geocode, cluster, embed, and load Atlas.","+  - Before choosing int8 embeddings over float32, measure their neighbours against float32's on real embeddings. Decision 33's check used synthetic vectors.","+  - The places autocomplete index, `places_search`, needs a free Search slot (decision 33). `make db-init` creates it once there is one."," - `make db-verify` runs geo, fuzzy and vector queries and checks their expected results and latencies."," - The top-case rule, and the follow-up harvest as a second Temporal pass."," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"311f71fc-6c36-4de7-9d90-340d6c57123d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
