{"parentUuid":"041300ed-87b8-4231-a4fb-0c2e101bfb4a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYrp6nz7ybbi7gLkVTse","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015NLKEKc9WUrGTEPjzGszi3","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md","old_string":"- `printings[]`: compact references (decision 32, rule 6). Each has:\n  - article ID, LCCN, paper title, publication place, state and date\n  - edition and page, when the scan record has them\n  - the page's IIIF `service`, once it is known\n  - `bbox_list`\n\n  Crop URLs are derived from `service` and `bbox_list` when a printing is read, never stored, and a printing keeps no text of its own.","new_string":"- `printings[]`: compact references (decision 32, rule 6), built by `paperghosts/store/printings.py`. Each has:\n  - article ID, LCCN, paper title, publication place, state and date\n  - edition, reel, issue and frame, from its member name. The issue is the date and a two-digit edition.\n  - page, from the scan record only, when it has one\n  - the page's IIIF `service`. It comes from the scan's batch path, or else only once a check confirms the page, because a member name can point one frame off (decision 33).\n  - `bbox_list`\n\n  Crop URLs are derived from `service` and `bbox_list` when a printing is read, never stored, and a printing keeps no text of its own."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":949,"cache_read_input_tokens":594659,"output_tokens":1022,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":27},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":949,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,