les, 1,554 as float32 and 402 as int8.\n  - **Cleanup:** the index was queryable in 28 s. The scratch collection and its index were then removed.\n- **`make db-init`** (`paperghosts/store/db_init.py`):\n  - It builds the four collections, their validators, section 4's indexes and the three Search indexes, as static mappings in code.\n  - It touches only database `paperghosts`, and in it only the collections in the plan. Phase 1's `skeleton` is left as it is.\n  - A run updated the two validators that `Printing` changed. The run after it printed \"nothing to change\".\n- **The third Search index can't be created yet.**\n  - M0's cap of three counts every database in the cluster, and `sample_mflix.movies` holds a Search index named `default`. So `places_search` isn't created.\n  - `make db-init` names the index it couldn't create, and exits 1 instead of stopping halfway.\n  - Freeing the slot is the owner's call, as dropping `sample_mflix` is (decision 32, rule 8).\n  - The cluster also holds a database `cubby`, with one collection, which isn't this project's. Nothing here touches it.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e1597618-5300-47d5-af07-a47cd35acd20","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":3},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberF