{"toolu_01WL8STwqMDJYFYqsXM6zxJD":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md","old_string":"  - **Page:** the page comes from the scan record only, and it is a number in 19.9% of them. It's never taken from the member's page token, which matches the scan's page for only 28.5% of 1910's candidates (the EM's count).","new_string":"  - **Page:** the page comes from the scan record only, where it is a number for 19.9% of candidates. It is never taken from the member name's page token.\n    - In 1910, the article ID and the member name differ only in that token, for 18,082 of 25,346 candidates (71.3%). Their date, LCCN, reel, issue and frame always agree.\n    - In those candidates the member gives a page number that the scan record doesn't confirm: the scan says \"na\" or nothing.\n    - Where the scan's page is a number, the two always agree."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ee67b89e-752a-4610-8f26-1d0b35bab327","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgYrtZ9rWiDtrn7wfMk3h","requestRef":"090f45bb-37b3-47ee-8da3-b4a2742f8c56","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1bdb5f19-cda1-4dd9-a694-4d84e99732ca","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:02:45.870Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"1bdb5f19-cda1-4dd9-a694-4d84e99732ca","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d9847e6d-1ff5-4ddf-ae83-97f1a4dc7124","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WL8STwqMDJYFYqsXM6zxJD","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (note: the file had been modified on disk since you last read it — the edit applied cleanly, but the file contains other changes not in your context. Read it before edits that depend on surrounding content.)"}]},"uuid":"8796ab95-63bb-4cbe-9045-4d33a19e8f3a","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:02:45.907Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md","oldString":"  - **Page:** the page comes from the scan record only, and it is a number in 19.9% of them. It's never taken from the member's page token, which matches the scan's page for only 28.5% of 1910's candidates (the EM's count).","newString":"  - **Page:** the page comes from the scan record only, where it is a number for 19.9% of candidates. It is never taken from the member name's page token.\n    - In 1910, the article ID and the member name differ only in that token, for 18,082 of 25,346 candidates (71.3%). Their date, LCCN, reel, issue and frame always agree.\n    - In those candidates the member gives a page number that the scan record doesn't confirm: the scan says \"na\" or nothing.\n    - Where the scan's page is a number, the two always agree.","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":404,"oldLines":7,"newStart":404,"newLines":10,"lines":["     - Every member name parses, and every issue is its date and two digits.","     - So edition, reel, issue and frame are required.","   - **LCCN:** 10,871 records (0.88%) have none, and those take the member's. Every record that has one agrees with its member name.","-  - **Page:** the page comes from the scan record only, and it is a number in 19.9% of them. It's never taken from the member's page token, which matches the scan's page for only 28.5% of 1910's candidates (the EM's count).","+  - **Page:** the page comes from the scan record only, where it is a number for 19.9% of candidates. It is never taken from the member name's page token.","+    - In 1910, the article ID and the member name differ only in that token, for 18,082 of 25,346 candidates (71.3%). Their date, LCCN, reel, issue and frame always agree.","+    - In those candidates the member gives a page number that the scan record doesn't confirm: the scan says \"na\" or nothing.","+    - Where the scan's page is a number, the two always agree.","   - **Service:** the IIIF service comes only from the scan's batch path, which 68.0% of candidates have. Where a candidate has both, the batch path's frame differs from its member's in 20,643 (2.5%), and the reel in 396.","     - Example: the member `…_1910021001_0164` and the jp2 `sn82016187/100493962/1910021001/0163.jp2`.","     - So a page located without a batch path can be the wrong one. Its crop waits for a check, whose error 2B's reel-map validation measures (`BUILD-PLAN.md`)."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"staleRecovered":true,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1bdb5f19-cda1-4dd9-a694-4d84e99732ca","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
