{"parentUuid":"b5bfe5c7-1baa-4f89-9b8f-1b4041bd6f7c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYrwpd7JzEKDjuWTyYnG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2B.1: RUNNING. All seven of the EM's fixes are in, and the branch is pushed; the budget is being remeasured on the final model.\n\n1. **Pushed:** `phase-2b-data-layer` is on origin, now with `1254820` for the fixes.\n2. **Location from the member name:** I checked all 1,236,122 v2 candidates. Every member name parses, so edition, reel, issue and frame are now required.\n   - The 10,871 records with no LCCN (0.88%) take the member's.\n   - The page comes only from the scan record.\n   - The article ID and the member name differ only in that page token, where the member often gives an unconfirmed page number.\n3. **Frame hazard:** where a candidate has a batch path, the member's frame is off in 20,643 of 841,054 (2.5%), so the IIIF service comes only from the batch path. Checking pages that have none is now a 2B plan item that measures that check's error.\n4. **Verified quotes:** a stated value needs a quote that verified. Both the model and Atlas's validator enforce it; Atlas rejects all 27 invalid test documents.\n5. **Dates:** the model checks year, month_day and decade against the date.\n6. **Search slot:** `sample_mflix` is untouched. `places_search` stays in the code and is pending. db-init's last run on the final model printed \"nothing to change\" and exits 1 only for that index.\n7. **Budget:** the probe is rerunning on the final model, which adds bytes to every printing. `BUDGET.md` follows. The earlier model measured 8,157 BSON bytes per story on average.\n\nThe int8 check on real embeddings is in the plan for 2D."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":334,"cache_read_input_tokens":605478,"output_tokens":551,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_t