{"parentUuid":"16f6b28f-a10c-4d15-affc-f492ab27bcc5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5cdf18f0-2d85-4e56-b04c-ea94ad2b37e1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MsRFt83JriXueSTHCT7RXB","type":"tool_result","content":" Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md | 92 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------\n Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md   |  5 +++\n Docs/DECISIONS.md    | 76 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 3 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)\n+  - Check a page located without a batch path before its crop is shown, and measure the check's error in the validation. One way is the scan's height and width against the IIIF `info.json`, and another is its OCR.\n+    - The check is needed because a member name can point at the wrong page. Where a candidate has both, its member's frame differs from its batch path's in 2.5% of them, and its reel in 396 (decision 33).\n+    - The batch path wins wherever it exists.\n+  - Before choosing int8 embeddings over float32, measure their neighbours against float32's on real embeddings. Decision 33's check used synthetic vectors.\n+  - The places autocomplete index, `places_search`, needs a free Search slot (decision 33). `make db-init` creates it once there is one.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6fd16636-5038-4792-8a20-47d08cf5fce5","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:09:21.497Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md | 92 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------\n Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md   |  5 +++\n Docs/DECISIONS.md    | 76 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 3 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)\n+  - Check a page located without a batch path before its crop is shown, and measure the check's error in the validation. One way is the scan's height and width against the IIIF `info.json`, and another is its OCR.\n+    - The check is needed because a member name can point at the wrong page. Where a candidate has both, its member's frame differs from its batch path's in 2.5% of them, and its reel in 396 (decision 33).\n+    - The batch path wins wherever it exists.\n+  - Before choosing int8 embeddings over float32, measure their neighbours against float32's on real embeddings. Decision 33's check used synthetic vectors.\n+  - The places autocomplete index, `places_search`, needs a free Search slot (decision 33). `make db-init` creates it once there is one.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"265e4abd-4589-4209-b302-2ed2cd931e47","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":3},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"16f6b28f-a10c-4d15-affc-f492ab27bcc5","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
