{"parentUuid":"0204d70e-c351-46b0-b1ca-4d47d5ba88f0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYsxDuCkp3pyHKbREJj5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016VanHAZXeNBN5Ej3pEziW9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && cat >> Docs/DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n- **The budget** (`BUDGET.md`, `eval/results/phase2b/budget.json`, `scripts/budget_probe.py`):\n  - **What counts:** Atlas counts data size plus B-tree index size, from `dbStats`, against the cap. Search indexes aren't in `dbStats`, and Free clusters have no Search size metrics, so by the docs they don't count. No page says so outright.\n  - **Free space:** of the 500,000,000 bytes planned for, 350.5 MB is free with `sample_mflix` and 499.4 MB without it.\n  - **A story's size:** 6,199 bytes before its printings, 454 per printing and 508 of indexes. Each figure is the larger of the 1,000 sampled candidates' and the 24 judged reports'.\n  - **Index sizes:** these come from a fresh scratch collection that was dropped afterwards. `reports` kept its index pages after an earlier probe run, which made its own sizes useless.\n  - **The top of the range** is 95,203 printings:\n    - At v1's ratio of 57,744 stories, it needs 430.5 MB as stored. That fits only without `sample_mflix`, or with every lever including int8 (346.9 MB).\n    - At one story per printing, it needs 681.8 MB, which M0 can't hold in any form. The smallest form is 552.9 MB.\n  - **The point estimates** of 30,183 stories need 225 MB, which fits either way.\n  - **The levers:**\n    - int16 boxes, the title lookup and the derived headline save 17 MB at the top of the range, all without loss.\n    - int8 saves 66.5 MB more, but only after 2D checks it on real embeddings.\n    - Turning rule 6's levers off would cost up to 206 MB.\n  - **Next:** the owner's options are listed in `BUDGET.md`, and the EM takes them to the owner with the Search slot.\nEOF\ntail -n 3 Docs/DECISIONS.md","description":"Append the budget findings to decision 33"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_read_input_tokens":665678,"output_tokens":1357,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":537},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":357,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1357,"cache_read_input_tokens":665678,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":357},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_016VanHAZXeNBN5Ej3pEziW9":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && cat >> Docs/DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n- **The budget** (`BUDGET.md`, `eval/results/phase2b/budget.json`, `scripts/budget_probe.py`):\n  - **What counts:** Atlas counts data size plus B-tree index size, from `dbStats`, against the cap. Search indexes aren't in `dbStats`, and Free clusters have no Search size metrics, so by the docs they don't count. No page says so outright.\n  - **Free space:** of the 500,000,000 bytes planned for, 350.5 MB is free with `sample_mflix` and 499.4 MB without it.\n  - **A story's size:** 6,199 bytes before its printings, 454 per printing and 508 of indexes. Each figure is the larger of the 1,000 sampled candidates' and the 24 judged reports'.\n  - **Index sizes:** these come from a fresh scratch collection that was dropped afterwards. `reports` kept its index pages after an earlier probe run, which made its own sizes useless.\n  - **The top of the range** is 95,203 printings:\n    - At v1's ratio of 57,744 stories, it needs 430.5 MB as stored. That fits only without `sample_mflix`, or with every lever including int8 (346.9 MB).\n    - At one story per printing, it needs 681.8 MB, which M0 can't hold in any form. The smallest form is 552.9 MB.\n  - **The point estimates** of 30,183 stories need 225 MB, which fits either way.\n  - **The levers:**\n    - int16 boxes, the title lookup and the derived headline save 17 MB at the top of the range, all without loss.\n    - int8 saves 66.5 MB more, but only after 2D checks it on real embeddings.\n    - Turning rule 6's levers off would cost up to 206 MB.\n  - **Next:** the owner's options are listed in `BUDGET.md`, and the EM takes them to the owner with the Search slot.\nEOF\ntail -n 3 Docs/DECISIONS.md","description":"Append the budget findings to decision 33"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"549d477b-6dba-48df-825d-c3e4b338c27e","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgYsxCuRVN2SJ92k8wnDB","requestRef":"e721ca33-7041-418b-aaa2-cd2e6ad1c10b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fd0fc200-d4fe-4a3e-808d-da996c5d2b5c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:16:41.195Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"fd0fc200-d4fe-4a3e-808d-da996c5d2b5c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"73ffbdbe-91de-482a-8537-c4fc06ab0338","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016VanHAZXeNBN5Ej3pEziW9","type":"tool_result","content":"    - int8 saves 66.5 MB more, but only after 2D checks it on real embeddings.\n    - Turning rule 6's levers off would cost up to 206 MB.\n  - **Next:** the owner's options are listed in `BUDGET.md`, and the EM takes them to the owner with the Search slot.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e6325c98-483d-4cbb-98a3-76234956300f","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:16:42.519Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"    - int8 saves 66.5 MB more, but only after 2D checks it on real embeddings.\n    - Turning rule 6's levers off would cost up to 206 MB.\n  - **Next:** the owner's options are listed in `BUDGET.md`, and the EM takes them to the owner with the Search slot.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":432,"oldLines":3,"newStart":432,"newLines":17,"lines":["   - Freeing the slot is the owner's call, as dropping `sample_mflix` is (decision 32, rule 8). The EM is taking it to the owner with the budget.","   - `places_search` stays in the code, so db-init creates it once there's a slot. Until then, it's pending.","   - The cluster also holds a database `cubby`, with one collection, which isn't this project's. Nothing here touches it.","+- **The budget** (`BUDGET.md`, `eval/results/phase2b/budget.json`, `scripts/budget_probe.py`):","+  - **What counts:** Atlas counts data size plus B-tree index size, from `dbStats`, against the cap. Search indexes aren't in `dbStats`, and Free clusters have no Search size metrics, so by the docs they don't count. No page says so outright.","+  - **Free space:** of the 500,000,000 bytes planned for, 350.5 MB is free with `sample_mflix` and 499.4 MB without it.","+  - **A story's size:** 6,199 bytes before its printings, 454 per printing and 508 of indexes. Each figure is the larger of the 1,000 sampled candidates' and the 24 judged reports'.","+  - **Index sizes:** these come from a fresh scratch collection that was dropped afterwards. `reports` kept its index pages after an earlier probe run, which made its own sizes useless.","+  - **The top of the range** is 95,203 printings:","+    - At v1's ratio of 57,744 stories, it needs 430.5 MB as stored. That fits only without `sample_mflix`, or with every lever including int8 (346.9 MB).","+    - At one story per printing, it needs 681.8 MB, which M0 can't hold in any form. The smallest form is 552.9 MB.","+  - **The point estimates** of 30,183 stories need 225 MB, which fits either way.","+  - **The levers:**","+    - int16 boxes, the title lookup and the derived headline save 17 MB at the top of the range, all without loss.","+    - int8 saves 66.5 MB more, but only after 2D checks it on real embeddings.","+    - Turning rule 6's levers off would cost up to 206 MB.","+  - **Next:** the owner's options are listed in `BUDGET.md`, and the EM takes them to the owner with the Search slot."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/DECISIONS.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"549d477b-6dba-48df-825d-c3e4b338c27e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":4},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fd0fc200-d4fe-4a3e-808d-da996c5d2b5c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
