{"parentUuid":"e2f703b8-d8ed-441f-b374-501993e3a5fe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYt5gofJVkqy8CrThfrX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Si4yKRkPmLxR5MGho8X9Ms","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nDecisions 32 and 33, ARCHITECTURE section 4, and BUDGET.md\n\nDecision 32 records M0's limits and the nine rules, with their source\nand date. Decision 33 records the data layer as built:\n- the models and validators, and the cross-field rules\n- printings located by member name, with the frame hazard\n- the BinData check\n- db-init, with places_search pending a Search slot\n- the budget\nSection 4 matches the models. BUDGET.md gives the free space, what\nAtlas counts with its sources, bytes by part and lever, the judged\nreports, and the stories that fit. Owner options are given where they\ndon't fit. The plan gains the page check, the int8 check on real\nembeddings, and places_search pending in 2D.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push origin phase-2b-data-layer 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; echo \"push exit ${pipestatus[1]}\"; echo \"local:  $(git rev-parse HEAD)\"; echo \"origin: $(git ls-remote origin refs/heads/phase-2b-data-layer | cut -f1)\"; git status -sb | head -1; git log --oneline origin/main..HEAD","description":"Commit the docs, push, and verify origin matches","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1147,"cache_read_input_tokens":672009,"output_tokens":589,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1147,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inf