{"parentUuid":"f6b3f838-eea5-46ff-9028-3e85f9988a4b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYtA6peJFZuiz3qM5sHq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2B.1: DONE, except `places_search`, which waits for a free Search slot. Branch `phase-2b-data-layer` is at `f6de6bc`, and `git ls-remote` shows the same commit on origin.\n\n- **Gate:** all 237 tests pass, live Atlas test included, and lint is clean. db-init's second run changes nothing; it exits 1 only to name `places_search`. `sample_mflix.movies` holds M0's third Search slot, and I left it alone.\n- **Your three points:**\n  - The push is fixed.\n  - `BUDGET.md` splits each story's bytes by part, measures each lever with `bson.encode`, and says what Atlas counts, with sources.\n  - 24 of the 25 judged reports are v2 candidates and were measured; the 1918 scout isn't, so it's never stored. The reports have shorter text than the 1,000 sampled candidates. The budget takes each figure from whichever is larger.\n- **Budget:** at the top of the range, 57,744 stories need 430.5 MB as stored. That fits only without `sample_mflix` (499.4 MB free), or with every lever including int8 (346.9 MB of 350.5). At one story per printing nothing fits M0; the point estimate needs 225 MB.\n\nOptions for the owner are in `BUDGET.md`; details in `step-2B.1.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3594,"cache_read_input_tokens":674123,"output_tokens":452,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3594,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":452,"cache_read_input_tokens":674123,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3594,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral