{"parentUuid":"4eb21a6a-2518-4926-9f7f-9b4298b9c010","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYtbVaZUXMVZcuzVETGB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Based on the ratios, the top-end estimate (61,960 stories) needs 458.8 MB raw or 370.1 MB fully optimized, meaning it won't fit alongside sample_mflix but fits otherwise (except rule-6-off variants); the point estimate (32,761 stories) fits either way at 242.3 MB. I'll add this third scenario to BUDGET.md.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2061,"cache_read_input_tokens":694155,"output_tokens":3034,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":593},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2061,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3034,"cache_read_input_tokens":694155,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2061},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"f6334924-4334-487e-9b52-9af7d36bb8c8","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgYtbUgjRn7oqZX8zSt41","requestRef":"3e2983d3-e5c4-40ee-a89a-0f8a05c659c2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a528334c-064c-438f-b6df-0874721c4db9","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:25:02.455Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"a528334c-064c-438f-b6df-0874721c4db9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYtbVaZUXMVZcuzVETGB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MNJSv9RUyz8iZqEavNcHBr","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUDGET.md","old_string":"The top of decisions 30 and 31's intervals is 74,027 + 21,176 = **95,203 report printings**. Two scenarios:\n- **v1's ratio** of 22,300 stories to 36,766 printings (decision 27) gives 57,744 stories.\n- **The worst case** is one story per printing: 95,203 stories.","new_string":"The top of decisions 30 and 31's intervals is 74,027 + 21,176 = **95,203 report printings**. Three scenarios:\n- **v1's ratio** of 22,300 stories to 36,766 printings (decision 27) gives 57,744 stories.\n- **The judged reports' ratio, by pool,** gives 61,960 stories (`scripts/budget_stories.py`, `eval/results/phase2b/budget_stories.json`).\n  - Each judged report counts as 1/k of a story when its v2 reprint cluster holds k printings.\n  - **v1's candidates:** eval A's 7 have clusters of 1, 1, 1, 13, 30, 1 and 7, so 0.608 stories per printing. That's decision 27's ratio again: 74,027 printings give 45,008 stories.\n  - **The candidates v2 added:** 2A.8's 14 and 3 of the screen's 4 have 12 clusters of 1, then 2, 2, 3, 5 and 10. That's 0.802 stories per printing: 21,176 printings give 16,952 stories.\n  - The spiritualist reports v2 adds are reprinted less often, so the same printings make more stories.\n- **The worst case** is one story per printing: 95,203 stories."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2061,"cache_read_input_tokens":694155,"output_tokens":3034,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":593},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2061,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3034,"cache_read_input_tokens":694155,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2061},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01MNJSv9RUyz8iZqEavNcHBr":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUDGET.md","old_string":"The top of decisions 30 and 31's intervals is 74,027 + 21,176 = **95,203 report printings**. Two scenarios:\n- **v1's ratio** of 22,300 stories to 36,766 printings (decision 27) gives 57,744 stories.\n- **The worst case** is one story per printing: 95,203 stories.","new_string":"The top of decisions 30 and 31's intervals is 74,027 + 21,176 = **95,203 report printings**. Three scenarios:\n- **v1's ratio** of 22,300 stories to 36,766 printings (decision 27) gives 57,744 stories.\n- **The judged reports' ratio, by pool,** gives 61,960 stories (`scripts/budget_stories.py`, `eval/results/phase2b/budget_stories.json`).\n  - Each judged report counts as 1/k of a story when its v2 reprint cluster holds k printings.\n  - **v1's candidates:** eval A's 7 have clusters of 1, 1, 1, 13, 30, 1 and 7, so 0.608 stories per printing. That's decision 27's ratio again: 74,027 printings give 45,008 stories.\n  - **The candidates v2 added:** 2A.8's 14 and 3 of the screen's 4 have 12 clusters of 1, then 2, 2, 3, 5 and 10. That's 0.802 stories per printing: 21,176 printings give 16,952 stories.\n  - The spiritualist reports v2 adds are reprinted less often, so the same printings make more stories.\n- **The worst case** is one story per printing: 95,203 stories."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"f6334924-4334-487e-9b52-9af7d36bb8c8","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgYtbUgjRn7oqZX8zSt41","requestRef":"3e2983d3-e5c4-40ee-a89a-0f8a05c659c2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ee8364cb-3983-4b1f-ba7f-0d7c6d4d3405","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:25:05.751Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
