one story per printing | 552.9 MB | no | no | 60,323 / 85,974 |\n\n**The judged reports' ratio changes one conclusion.** At v1's ratio, every lever, int8 included, just fits beside `sample_mflix`. At the judged ratio nothing does: the smallest form needs 370.1 MB of the 350.5 MB free. Without `sample_mflix`, every form fits, as before."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2061,"cache_read_input_tokens":694155,"output_tokens":3034,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":593},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2061,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3034,"cache_read_input_tokens":694155,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2061},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Ri6xsb9Q1vkYaiQPpStaav":{"file_path":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUDGET.md","old_string":"| As stored | v1's ratio | 430.5 MB | no | **yes** | 47,007 / 66,975 |\n| As stored | one story per printing | 681.8 MB | no | no | 48,941 / 69,732 |\n| int8 embedding | v1's ratio | 364.0 MB | no | yes | 55,597 / 79,215 |\n| int8 embedding | one story per printing | 572.1 MB | no | no | 58,324 / 83,100 |\n| The three | v1's ratio | 413.4 MB | no | yes | 48,947 / 69,761 |\n| The three | one story per printing | 662.6 MB | no | no | 50,333 / 71,737 |\n| The three, with int8 | v1's ratio | 346.9 MB | yes, with 3.6 MB to spare | yes | 58,343 / 83,152 |\n| The three, with int8 | one story per printing | 552.9 MB | no | no | 60,323 / 85,974 |","new_string":"| As stored | v1's rat