 <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"Docs/BUDGET.md\")\nt = p.read_text()\nold1 = \"so 0.608 stories per printing. That's decision 27's ratio again: 74,027 printings give 45,008 stories.\"\nnew1 = \"so 0.608 stories per printing. That's decision 27's ratio again: 74,027 printings give 44,978 stories.\"\nold2 = \"That's 0.802 stories per printing: 21,176 printings give 16,952 stories.\"\nnew2 = \"That's 0.802 stories per printing: 21,176 printings give 16,982 stories.\"\nassert old1 in t and old2 in t\np.write_text(t.replace(old1, new1).replace(old2, new2))\nprint(\"ok\")\nPY","description":"Correct the per-pool story counts in BUDGET.md"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"30041282-eea5-4953-ab37-0b8c575b4319","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgYte66mQFu2DEi5n54v9","requestRef":"eafb4376-6701-46f8-92f1-8892de7ec9bc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7674bce1-c626-4f33-b878-827788fb3c4d","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:25:33.566Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
{"parentUuid":"7674bce1-c626-4f33-b878-827788fb3c4d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fdb4383a-0e1d-45d1-a3f9-1b2691993af6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W38nha2Q5xjzGafK8vHy7r","type":"tool_result","content":"ok","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5bc9ae7b-cfa4-4f36-a84b-f01b877c75b8","timestamp":"2026-10-30T18:25:34.685Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"ok","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUDGET.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":85,"oldLines":8,"newStart":85,"newLines":8,"lines":[" - **v1's ratio** of 22,300 stories to 36,766 printings (decision 27) gives 57,744 stories."," - **The judged reports' ratio, by pool,** gives 61,960 stories (`scripts/budget_stories.py`, `eval/results/phase2b/budget_stories.json`).","   - Each judged report counts as 1/k of a story when its v2 reprint cluster holds k printings.","-  - **v1's candidates:** eval A's 7 have clusters of 1, 1, 1, 13, 30, 1 and 7, so 0.608 stories per printing. That's decision 27's ratio again: 74,027 printings give 45,008 stories.","-  - **The candidates v2 added:** 2A.8's 14 and 3 of the screen's 4 have 12 clusters of 1, then 2, 2, 3, 5 and 10. That's 0.802 stories per printing: 21,176 printings give 16,952 stories.","+  - **v1's candidates:** eval A's 7 have clusters of 1, 1, 1, 13, 30, 1 and 7, so 0.608 stories per printing. That's decision 27's ratio again: 74,027 printings give 44,978 stories.","+  - **The candidates v2 added:** 2A.8's 14 and 3 of the screen's 4 have 12 clusters of 1, then 2, 2, 3, 5 and 10. That's 0.802 stories per printing: 21,176 printings give 16,982 stories.","   - The spiritualist reports v2 adds are reprinted less often, so the same printings make more stories."," - **The worst case** is one story per printing: 95,203 stories."," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUDGET.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"30041282-eea5-4953-ab37-0b8c575b4319","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"7674bce1-c626-4f33-b878-827788fb3c4d","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
