{"parentUuid":"290a11b1-c77e-48d2-8bb2-5c5bf88d0267","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fdb4383a-0e1d-45d1-a3f9-1b2691993af6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LrserUYW8p6ekCsyNTbRmu","type":"tool_result","content":"## Next step\n\n**Phase 2B: schemas and data layer** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), on branch `phase-2b-data-layer`.\n- **Step 2B.1 is built**, and waits on the EM's review (decisions 32 and 33): the models and validators, the BinData check, `make db-init` and `BUDGET.md`.\n  - **Pending:** `places_search`. `sample_mflix` holds M0's third Search slot, and freeing it is the owner's call.\n  - **The owner's call:** what to do if the reader's real count needs more storage than M0 has (`BUDGET.md`). The EM takes both to the owner.\n- **Step 2B.2 is built**, and waits on the EM's review (decision 34): the title parser, the loc.gov title records, the title lookup and the GeoNames geocoder.\n- **Step 2B.3,** the reel-to-batch map and the page check, follows.\n- Lexicon v2 keeps all five rules (decision 31).\n\nNeeds the owner's yes when we get there:\n- the Render deploy\n- domain DNS\n\n## STATUS: Phase 2A, archive read, EDA and lexicon v2 (2026-10-30)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ef22db75-9ce2-4aae-93fc-3f539f0abc05","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:01:40.199Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Next step\n\n**Phase 2B: schemas and data layer** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), on branch `phase-2b-data-layer`.\n- **Step 2B.1 is built**, and waits on the EM's review (decisions 32 and 33): the models and validators, the BinData check, `make db-init` and `BUDGET.md`.\n  - **Pending:** `places_search`. `sample_mflix` holds M0's third Search slot, and freeing it is the owner's call.\n  - **The owner's call:** what to do if the reader's real count needs more storage than M0 has (`BUDGET.md`). The EM takes both to the owner.\n- **Step 2B.2 is built**, and waits on the EM's review (decision 34): the title parser, the loc.gov title records, the title lookup and the GeoNames geocoder.\n- **Step 2B.3,** the reel-to-batch map and the page check, follows.\n- Lexicon v2 keeps all five rules (decision 31).\n\nNeeds the owner's yes when we get there:\n- the Render deploy\n- domain DNS\n\n## STATUS: Phase 2A, archive read, EDA and lexicon v2 (2026-10-30)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8a99a4ca-ecaf-43c0-a979-30721e3dad57","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":6,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":5},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"290a11b1-c77e-48d2-8bb2-5c5bf88d0267","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
