{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","prNumber":3,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Hotragn/Paperghosts/pull/3","prRepository":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:29:20.287Z"}
{"parentUuid":"355d2f39-4ac6-4576-a44a-3eeeb7db77d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgYyWWfVByif8AYxnfqSp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2B.2: BLOCKED — on the queued loc.gov fetch (about 25 minutes), not on you. When it finishes I'll report DONE with the accuracy with and without the record check.\n\nWhat's built and committed so far (not pushed):\n- **`2e2fc32`:** the Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands dumps are now inputs, listed in the manifest. No title names any other territory. \"(historical)\" ghost towns are accepted only in the record's county, and county matching respects the record's state.\n- **`c8e01f7`:** the lookup keeps each paper's place as its record catalogues it, so a renamed town shows as \"Bloomington, Iowa (now Muscatine)\".\n- **`7ac574b`:** the record check itself, in `paperghosts/geo/papers.py`.\n\nMeasured so far, from the cache only, with 23 of the 200 records: without the check, 194/200 are right, since Ponce resolves now. That first run also exposed a bug: loc.gov's Alaskan county names (\"Seward\") aren't GeoNames' counties, and the check turned a right answer into no point. A county GeoNames doesn't have now leaves the place unchecked. That rule was made on these 200, so the with-check figure will be partly in-sample, and decision 34 will say so.\n\nThe 2D record fetch and the 2C/2D story-place rule are now in the plan. Decision 34 is drafted with placeholders for the numbers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1651,"cache_read_input_tokens":238669,"output_tokens":474,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1651,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens