{"parentUuid":"f649bb5e-24f4-444c-8bb9-9420ad9da9a8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b997187a-e537-4e1f-b3c7-20b1dfc34455","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NNkg6hzf7cNk868Vz7ySbo","type":"tool_result","content":" Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md | 7 +++++++\n Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md   | 5 +++++\n 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9fe39718-bb22-4167-bf66-3e961372245a","timestamp":"2026-10-30T20:05:42.696Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md | 7 +++++++\n Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md   | 5 +++++\n 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":113,"oldLines":7,"newStart":113,"newLines":7,"lines":["   - what the cataloguer supplied","   - its place as its loc.gov title record catalogues it today, where the record was fetched","   - its state today","-- The site shows the printed place, with what has changed since: \"Charlestown, Va. (now W.Va.)\", \"Bloomington, Iowa (now Muscatine)\".","+- The site shows the printed place, with what has changed since: \"Charlestown, Va. (now W.Va.)\". It names the record's town only where the paper's point is the record's place: \"East Saginaw, Mich. (now Saginaw)\"."," - A paper's point is its printed place, checked against its title record's county (`paperghosts/geo/papers.py`). A place outside that county gives way to the record's place. Where nothing agrees with the record, there is no point."," - Printings of the same story are grouped. Counts on the site say which they count: stories or printings."," - Stories get one embedding each, from the earliest legible printing."]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":138,"oldLines":7,"newStart":138,"newLines":7,"lines":["   - The places autocomplete index, `places_search`, needs a free Search slot (decision 33). `make db-init` creates it once there is one.","   - Fetch the loc.gov title records only for the LCCNs among stored printings, as decision 29 does for pages, cached (`paperghosts/geo/loc.py`). A paper's place is checked against its record (decision 34), and without one it stands unchecked.","   - Story places follow 2C's rule: a county or state the text gives, or the dateline, and never the paper's state.","-  - Measure any further geocoder fix on a fresh draw of papers, never on decision 34's 200. The first of two towns joined by \"and\" is one.","+  - Measure the record check, and any further geocoder fix, on a fresh draw of papers, never on decision 34's 200. The first of two towns joined by \"and\" is one such fix.","   - The title lookup by LCCN (decision 34) holds each paper's place and state once. Whether it replaces every printing's copy is `BUDGET.md`'s lever."," - `make db-verify` runs geo, fuzzy and vector queries and checks their expected results and latencies."," - The top-case rule, and the follow-up harvest as a second Temporal pass."]}]},{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/eval/results/phase2b/geocoder_expected.json","hunks":[{"oldStart":754,"oldLines":7,"newStart":754,"newLines":7,"lines":["   \"Norfolk and Portsmouth|Virginia\": {","    \"place_id\": 4776222,","    \"failure\": \"two towns named as one place\",","-   \"note\": \"Norfolk day book (Norfolk and Portsmouth Va.): printed in Norfolk\"","+   \"note\": \"Norfolk day book (Norfolk and Portsmouth Va.): Norfolk, from its title. Its title record gives Portsmouth as its place, and its notes say it was published in both\"","   },","   \"Davenport|Iowa\": {","    \"place_id\": 4853423,"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md","/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Papergho