{"parentUuid":"de801bc1-3de5-4e97-8e9f-4659ac515624","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"eb4299df-98e8-4a21-a6f8-2c287186b7f2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VPMJS36Ch4iZzEJ2KEJZco","type":"tool_result","content":"Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md:89:- The reel-to-batch map (decision 29):\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:93:  - Check a page located without a batch path before its crop is shown, and measure the check's error in the validation. One way is the scan's height and width against the IIIF `info.json`, and another is its OCR.\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:96:- No loc.gov lookups yet for the 27,817 candidates whose reels the map doesn't cover. At 20 a minute they would take about a day, and most won't be reports.\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:98:  - Cache each answer, which `page_service` doesn't do yet, so no page is looked up twice.\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:104:- The reel-to-batch map's hit rate on hidden batches is reported, and every reel with more than one batch is flagged.\nDocs/RESUME.md:17:- **Step 2B.3,** the reel-to-batch map and the page check, follows.\nDocs/RESUME.md:79:- 27,817 of v2's candidates need loc.gov to name their page's IIIF service, and its JSON API allows 20 requests a minute. 2B looks them up only for reports (decision 29).","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"24e8687d-3458-45db-8b7f-a005b95eade2","timestamp":"2026-10-31T00:38:36.087Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md:89:- The reel-to-batch map (decision 29):\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:93:  - Check a page located without a batch path before its crop is shown, and measure the check's error in the validation. One way is the scan's height and width against the IIIF `info.json`, and another is its OCR.\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:96:- No loc.gov lookups yet for the 27,817 candidates whose reels the map doesn't cover. At 20 a minute they would take about a day, and most won't be reports.\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:98:  - Cache each answer, which `page_service` doesn't do yet, so no page is looked up twice.\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:104:- The reel-to-batch map's hit rate on hidden batches is reported, and every reel with more than one batch is flagged.\nDocs/RESUME.md:17:- **Step 2B.3,** the reel-to-batch map and the page check, follows.\nDocs/RESUME.md:79:- 27,817 of v2's candidates need loc.gov to name their page's IIIF service, and its JSON API allows 20 requests a minute. 2B looks them up only for reports (decision 29).","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0ab0e1bd-2057-4f5f-b073-6b72269d0323","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":4,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":6},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"de801bc1-3de5-4e97-8e9f-4659ac515624","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
