{"parentUuid":"4c73da37-20d7-442d-bafa-6955130a6d1c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e9ec6031-6d70-425a-a94b-94b6c6cc5b96","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CkQLEAnzeNSqqsy7jmLyfo","type":"tool_result","content":"### 3B: API and static export\n**Persona:** software engineer.\n- FastAPI endpoints from `SRS.md` section 6, with contract tests, Sentry, the privacy tests and latency measurements.\n- `export_static`, plus the cached crops for the front page and the top cases.\n\n**Gate**\n- Tests are green, and the OpenAPI document is generated.\n- Latency numbers are recorded.\n- The export can be reproduced.\n\n## 6. Phase 4: frontend and integration\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:96:    - Decision 35 found the opposite for the frame: where the two differ, the member's frame was the page in 18 of 18. Whether the stored service takes its frame from the member is the EM's call.\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:142:  - A crop is fetched through `crops_for`, which checks a page with no batch path before its crop is shown, by its size and its OCR (decision 35).\nDocs/ARCHITECTURE.md:182:    - Where the member name and the batch path name different frames, the member's was the page in 18 of 18 checked (decision 35). Which one the stored service follows is the EM's call.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cc23bf28-6750-45da-818b-880d83c8d383","timestamp":"2026-10-31T01:40:08.154Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"### 3B: API and static export\n**Persona:** software engineer.\n- FastAPI endpoints from `SRS.md` section 6, with contract tests, Sentry, the privacy tests and latency measurements.\n- `export_static`, plus the cached crops for the front page and the top cases.\n\n**Gate**\n- Tests are green, and the OpenAPI document is generated.\n- Latency numbers are recorded.\n- The export can be reproduced.\n\n## 6. Phase 4: frontend and integration\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:96:    - Decision 35 found the opposite for the frame: where the two differ, the member's frame was the page in 18 of 18. Whether the stored service takes its frame from the member is the EM's call.\nDocs/BUILD-PLAN.md:142:  - A crop is fetched through `crops_for`, which checks a page with no batch path before its crop is shown, by its size and its OCR (decision 35).\nDocs/ARCHITECTURE.md:182:    - Where the member name and the batch path name different frames, the member's was the page in 18 of 18 checked (decision 35). Which one the stored service follows is the EM's call.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7fbe3271-f1bd-489e-97da-969fac400b77","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":8,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4c73da37-20d7-442d-bafa-6955130a6d1c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
