e thought Of the uninteresting solitude of the place was going to. The misgiving was speedily allayed on arriving at my destination, and the new sphere Of life in which / found myself proved interesting beyond measure. | met a hospitable welcome, was politely es, corted to one OF the guest chambers and requested to make myself as com, Portable as possible. The apartment to which / had been allotted was marked by the simplicity which char acterizes the establishment.\n=== eval-0211\n  first: The Carlisle independent. 1919-02-06 | REGULAR coNNoIssEUR.\n    Cert tof the gloves)-My beau is an excellent judge of pictures. Nell (of the notions)-Does he haunt the galleries? Cert (warmly)--He never sits no- where but the orchestra, I'll have you know. And, furthermore, I'll betcha a 30-cent sundae that he can drop into any movie in town right In the middle of the reel and tell you the name of the producing company and the prin- cipal actor.-Buffalo Express.\n  second: The Ocala evening star. [volume] (Ocala, Fla.) 189 1919-11-07 | REGULAR coNNoIssEUR.\n    Cert (of the gloves)-My beau In an excellent judge Of pictures. Nell (of the notions)-Does he haunt the galleries? Cert (warmly)-He never sits no where but the orchestra, I'll have you know. And, Furthermore, I'll betcha q 30-cent sundae that he can drop into any movie In town right in the middle Of the reel and tell you the name of the producing company and the prin- cipal actor.-Buffalo Express.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"32ce8074-02da-4195-8fca-961813c98de6","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":4},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"ori