ramp of an Infatuated ostrich, no words will describe it. The nearest approach to it is the sound of the regular thud, thud of soldiers on the march. ssThere was nc mistake. Wewere being pursued by a furious cock ostrich, a for midable foe indeed The pony's feet seemed scarcely to touch the ground, and I bent forward, urging him on as / had never lone before. Nearer and nearer came the beating, the distance between us and our strange pursuer growing less ey-\n=== eval-0622\n  first: New Orleans Republican. [volume] (New Orleans, La) 1871-05-07 | Nasty.\n\nMr.. Nasty Attempts Ku-KInx Enter\npriss-The LamentabIe Failure\n    / = April TO- 1871. We hev four distinct elemence witch 90 make up the sum total NV society in til lmmeJit visinity, namely: Regler citizen nlggers, carpet-baggers, and scalawags I'll { regler citizens are them witch are white, n; tive and to the manner born, and vic either served in or howled for the Confedrj army; the scalawags are white natives IL the sacred soil witch disgraced theirselve sympathizin with the North doorin the lat tratrisidle struggle; the niggers are niger Nv all cOlors, and the carpet-baggers are u1 settled Northern men, witch come here an, buy property and\n  second: New national era. [volume] (Washington, D.C.) 1870 1871-05-25 | n A s h Y.\n\nMr.. Nasty Attempts q Ku-Kiux Enterprise\nThe Lamentable Fa\n    MT. Naeby attempts hu-fAiuN hhteTpsAse The Lamentabie Failure OF the Expe- ditisn. CoSFEDR1T Y ROADS, (Which is in the State of Kentucky April III, 1871. We hev our dstict elemence witch go to make up the sum total Nv society in this i'm mejit vicinity, namely: Reglar citizens mig gers, carpet-baggers, and scallawags. The reglar citizens are them witch are white native, and inhowled for the confedrit army the scalawags are white natives Nv the sacred sol! witch disgraced themselves sympathiZin' with the North doorin' the late fratrislde Struggle the niggers are niggers Nv all colors, and the carpet-baggers are","is_error"