and is a nice quiet place to rest and read when waiting for boats or the ferry. se\n  second: The Alaska daily empire. [volume] (Juneau, Alaska) 1922-11-11 | ASSEMBLY OF GOD MISSION\n    Chhs C. Personeus. Leader. Sunday School at 1890. z Gospel services held every Sun lay. Tuesday and Friday evenings 1T 1880. Communion service the nrst Sun. lay OF each month. Full gospel truths Of the Bible taught-salsation, sanctihcation, d. vine healing, baptism Of tho Holy Ghost and the Lords second coming. Everyone is cordially invitsd 70 these servicea = 80.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"d3a8f685-7880-43f8-9e00-d6af5db708ee","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":2,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":4},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"869b69ba-fcd9-4f8e-bce0-f182c0d56452","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2b-data-layer","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
