{"parentUuid":"f03e7387-a7e8-4c98-b849-c93e26ba0bdd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZX4giVF4SpsUGsugkBs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011grAC1c45fzwDxovbryrnL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nThe reprint evaluation set, labelled and frozen before any tuning, and its dev set\n\neval/clusters/eval.json: 667 pairs drawn from eval A's clusters (seed\n\"2B.4 eval\"): 200 per candidate, 100 per cluster, the least similar pair of\nevery one of the 207 clusters of 50 printings or more, 80 near the\nthreshold, and 80 from the body probe. dev.json: 160 more for tuning.\n17 reading agents labelled them, blind to set, stratum and score\n(LABELLING.md). I re-judged a seeded 10% of each stratum's commoner label\nblind, and agreed on 61 of 61, and read every rarer label and close call in\nfull. frozen.json holds eval.json's sha256 (094d4070...754c), before tuning.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push origin phase-2b-data-layer 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\" | tail -1 && git ls-remote origin refs/heads/phase-2b-data-layer && git rev-parse HEAD && git log --oneline -3","description":"Commit the frozen set, push, and check with ls-remote","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1161,"cache_read_input_tokens":796563,"output_tokens":557,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":557,"cache_read_input_tokens":796563,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1161,"cache