{"parentUuid":"174751d8-0259-4fe2-99e7-c240a36e6a3b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e9ec6031-6d70-425a-a94b-94b6c6cc5b96","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JCJ2WZRxciEwPqeKXarqZ3","type":"tool_result","content":"RESUME updated\nmake lint exit 0\n M Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md\n M Docs/BUDGET.md\n M Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md\n M Docs/DECISIONS.md\n M Docs/RESUME.md\n M eval/results/phase2b/budget_stories.json\n M scripts/budget_stories.py\n M scripts/clusters.py\n?? eval/clusters/tuning.json\n?? eval/results/phase2b/clusters.json","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c6f92805-2780-4f13-940b-1725c5e3f4e0","timestamp":"2026-10-31T02:41:58.550Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"RESUME updated\nmake lint exit 0\n M Docs/ARCHITECTURE.md\n M Docs/BUDGET.md\n M Docs/BUILD-PLAN.md\n M Docs/DECISIONS.md\n M Docs/RESUME.md\n M eval/results/phase2b/budget_stories.json\n M scripts/budget_stories.py\n M scripts/clusters.py\n?? eval/clusters/tuning.json\n?? eval/results/phase2b/clusters.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/RESUME.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":6,"oldLines":21,"newStart":6,"newLines":79,"lines":[" "," ## Next step"," ","-**Phase 2B: schemas and data layer** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), on branch `phase-2b-data-layer`.","-- **Step 2B.1 passed the EM's review** (decisions 32 and 33): the models and validators, the BinData check, `make db-init` and `BUDGET.md`.","-  - **Pending:** `places_search`. `sample_mflix` holds M0's third Search slot, and freeing it is the owner's call.","-  - **The owner's call:** what to do if the reader's real count needs more storage than M0 has (`BUDGET.md`). The EM takes both to the owner.","-- **Step 2B.2 passed the EM's review** (decision 34): the title parser and lookup, the GeoNames geocoder and the record check. Norfolk and Portsmouth's rule stays.","-- **Step 2B.3 passed the EM's review** (decision 35): the reel-to-batch map, the page check and `page_service`'s cache.","-  - The EM's call: where only the frame differs, the stored service takes the member's frame. That changes 20,247 candidates' service.","-- **Step 2B.4,** the reprint clustering and its evaluation set (decision 36), is under way.","-- Phase 2B's PR comes when 2B closes.","+**Phase 2C: the reader** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), once Phase 2B's PR is merged. It starts with `POLICY.md` and the gold set, split by story id (decision 36)."," - Lexicon v2 keeps all five rules (decision 31)."," "," Needs the owner's yes when we get there:"," - the Render deploy"," - domain DNS"," ","+## STATUS: Phase 2B, schemas and data layer (2026-10-30)","+","+Branch `phase-2b-data-layer`, in four steps, each reviewed by the EM; one PR into `main` at the end.","+","+Built:","+- **2B.1** (decisions 32 and 33):","+  - Pydantic models for every collection, and Atlas validators generated from them","+  - BinData embeddings","+  - `make db-init`, which creates every collection and index and can run twice","+  - `BUDGET.md`, a storage budget from real document sizes","+- **2B.2** (decision 34):","+  - the LCCN title parser, tested on 200 titles checked by hand","+  - loc.gov title records, cached","+  - the title lookup by LCCN","+  - the GeoNames geocoder over the US, Puerto Rico and Virgin Islands dumps, with its manifest","+  - the record check, which checks each paper's place against its title record's county","+- **2B.3** (decision 35):","+  - the reel-to-batch map","+  - the page check, which looks at a page's size and its OCR before its crop is shown","+  - `page_service`'s cache of every Library of Congress answer","+  - CAPTCHA pages treated as busy","+  - the EM's frame rule: where only the frame differs, the member's frame","+- **2B.4** (decision 36):","+  - reprint stories, in which a printing joins a story only by matching its first printing directly","+  - their evaluation set, labelled and frozen before tuning, and a dev set to tune on","+","+Measured:","+- **Geocoder:** 98.0% (95.0–99.2%) of 200 papers' places are right with the record check, and 97.0% without it.","+- **Reel-to-batch map:**","+  - It names a batch for 370,949 of the 395,068 candidates with no batch path (93.9%).","+  - With each issue hidden in turn, it gets 99.78% of issues right, and 85.3% on the 257 flagged reels.","+- **Page check:** 0 false accepts of 90 frames beside the page (0–4.1%), and 2 false rejects of 85 own frames (0.6–8.2%).","+- **Frames:** where only the frame differs, the member's frame was the page in 18 of 18. That changes 20,247 candidates' stored service.","+- **Stories:**","+  - Precision per candidate is 100% (97.7–100%), against eval A's 98.0%, and recall is 84.7% (79.0–89.1%).","+  - The chaining in 54 of the 207 largest clusters is split in 51.","+  - v2 has 974,399 distinct stories, and the reader's job is 1,002,205 printings.","+- **Storage:** the top of the range, 62,402 stories, needs 461.8 MB as stored, so it fits on M0 only without `sample_mflix`.","+- **Requests to the Library of Congress:**","+  - 2B.2's title records: 327 in the final build and 177 for the 200 pairs.","+  - 2B.3's measurements: 549, against the 600 planned.","+","+Gate:","+- Tests and lint pass. `make db-init` runs twice.","+- The budget is written down (`BUDGET.md`).","+- Geocoder accuracy is measured on a sample of 200, with and without the record check.","+- The map's hit rate on hidden issues is reported, and all 257 reels with more than one batch are flagged in `reels.json`.","+- The page check's error rates are measured, with intervals.","+- The clustering evaluation set's sha256 is in `eval/clusters/frozen.json`, pushed before tuning. Its precision and recall are measured, and every chained large cluster is explained and its fix measured.","+- Every claim of a push was checked with `git ls-remote`.","+","+Risks and open questions:","+- **`places_search` waits on the owner:** `sample_mflix` holds M0's third Search slot (decision 33).","+- **Storage:** if the reader's real count needs more than M0 has, it's the owner's call (`BUDGET.md`).","+- **The stories miss reprints:**","+  - Eval A's links miss reprints whose openings differ. The body probe found 76 of 80 such pairs to be one story. 2D measures adding the body's links on a fresh draw.","+  - The stories split 15% of true reprints, mostly through OCR noise.","+  - Three large clusters still join two texts that each hold a short first printing.","+- **loc.gov lookups and the page check:**","+  - 24,119 candidates with no batch path sit on reels the map doesn't know. They need loc.gov, and only for reports.","+  - The page check costs 2 requests and about 1 MB of ALTO a page. About 21,000 checks would cache about 4 GB, inside the 10 GB data budget only if gzipped or reduced to each result (2D).","+- **In-sample choices:**","+  - The page check's threshold, a fifth, came from 38 calibration pages. The 90 measured pairs were fresh.","+  - The geocoder's two in-sample rules: 2D measures them on a fresh draw (decision 34).","+- **The reader** reads 974,399 first printings and 27,806 longer members. The Tinker credit check weighs that before 2C's full pass.","+"," ## STATUS: Phase 2A, archive read, EDA and lexicon v2 (2026-10-30)"," "," Branches `phase-2a-archive` (PR #2, merged) and `phase-2a-lexicon-v2` (PR #3, step 2A.8)."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts/Docs/RESUME.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8a0cc523-22d8-4253-a90a-fab295c4056c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2b-data-layer","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":7,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"