{"parentUuid":"9c6e0fb0-5800-44f4-b3dd-367f21f1fec8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZYkTYTSufGBozbW7qZ8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"2B.4: DONE, and 2B is closed. Hotragn/Paperghosts#4 is open into `main` at `42c96c2`, which `ls-remote` confirms; its CI was still pending. 355 tests and lint pass. The hand-over note is `step-2B.4.md`.\n\n- **Your six 2B.3 calls:** done. The frame rule changes 20,247 candidates' service, and CAPTCHA pages now count as busy.\n- **Stories:** a printing joins a story only by matching its first printing. Scored once on 667 pairs frozen before tuning (at `f86021f`): precision 100% (97.7–100%) and recall 84.7% per candidate. They split 51 of the 54 chained large clusters.\n- **Your call:** at five to one, eval A's clusters cost 20 per candidate and the stories 30. On dev, it's 40 against 22. I'd use the stories, since a false merge can hide a report. That raises reader work 5.2%.\n- **Recall gap:** 76 of 80 body-probe pairs are reprints that eval A's links miss. I propose adding body links, measured in 2D on a fresh draw."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":475,"cache_read_input_tokens":858812,"output_tokens":383,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":475,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":383,"cache_read_input_tokens":858812,"cache_creation_input_tokens":475,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":475},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7be5c378-d961-462f-bcba-872a85267e26","apiBlock