{"parentUuid":"0145f777-14ff-4992-b126-436f80f722de","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"22277250-1783-45bc-9d5b-e32f754ab6c5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AaA9FhfgZSg2HJ2EKM8vFb","type":"tool_result","content":" M paperghosts/cluster/reprints.py\n M tests/test_reprints.py\n2467e28 Decision 36: the EM's calls, the reader on every candidate, and the 400-word check\naab6290 The EM's check of the reading agents' 400 words, as a committed script\n6cd57e2 POLICY.md, the gold labelling rules, before any draw or label (RDR-3)\ne350721 Merge pull request #4 from Hotragn/phase-2b-data-layer\n42c96c2 Decision 36, the plan's notes for 2C and 2D, and Phase 2B's STATUS block\n paperghosts/cluster/reprints.py | 10 ++++++----\n tests/test_reprints.py          | 13 +++++++++++++\n 2 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)\neval/gold/:\nPOLICY.md\n\neval/results/:\neval_a\neval_a.json\neval_a_v2\neval_a_v2.json\nphase1\nphase1_env.json\nphase2a\nphase2b\n\nscripts/:\nbindata_check.py\nbudget_probe.py\nbudget_stories.py\ncharts.py\ncheck_keys.py\nclusters.py\ncrop_check.py\neval_a.py\ngeocode_check.py\nheadline_drops.py\nlexicon_v2.py\nload_skeleton.py\npage_check.py\nphase1_env.py\nprefilter_year.py\nreel_map.py\ntitles.py\nverify_precheck.py\n/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-hotragn-Documents-Claude-Code-HacktoberFest-week4-Paperghosts/1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b/scratchpad:\nadded\nafter-restart.json\nafter-retry.json\nb3\nb4\nbefore.json\nbindata-check.log\nbudget-probe.log\nbudget_math.py\nc1\ncharts\ncharts-v2\ncheck_keys.py\nci-step.log\nclipping-probe.log\ncommit-72ef622.diff\ncompare_rules.log\ncompare_rules.py\nconfig.py\ncontainment.py\ncounts-1850-first-run.json\ncrop_check.py.keep\ncrops.py.keep\ndb-init-1.log\ndb-init-final.log\ndb-init-runs.log\ndryrun.py\neval-run.log\neval-run2.log\neval-run3.log\neval-v1-repro.log\neval-v1-repro2.log\neval-v2.log\neval_a.keep.py\nfinal\ngeocheck-final.log\ngeocheck-rerun.log\ng