l/results/investigations.json` |\n\n### 2.6 API (API)\n| ID | Requirement | Verified by |\n|---|---|---|\n| API-1 | The endpoints in section 6 are implemented with input validation, pagination and a consistent error format. | Contract tests |\n| API-2 | `/api/near` rounds coordinates to 2 decimal places, never logs them, and keeps them out of Sentry. | A test with a log-capture fixture |\n| API-3 | CORS allows only the site's own origins. Responses carry cache headers. | Tests |\n| API-4 | `/api/health` reports whether Atlas is reachable. Sentry is wired up with no PII. | Test, plus a Sentry event |\n| API-5 | p95 latency is measured for every endpoint against Atlas. | `eval/results/api_latency.json` |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"34e59b8a-d7be-4d21-b48d-9c401a5d9456","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2c-reader","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"180b2397-4341-41b6-bcc1-b8d120345e34","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b"