{"parentUuid":"564697f1-ddae-4ead-b5ea-85fd308dade5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"22277250-1783-45bc-9d5b-e32f754ab6c5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KCsohFkGvECYrMboAL7xfL","type":"tool_result","content":"Model selection uses a dev split. The gold set is used only for these final runs.\n\n### 7.3 Edge-case suite\nEach slice uses at least 5 gold items where the archive has them:\n- E1: sermons and hymns about the Holy Ghost\n- E2: idioms (\"ghost of a chance\", \"gave up the ghost\", \"not the ghost of a\")\n- E3: ghost stories as fiction, serials and Christmas stories\n- E4: theatre and illusion adverts (Pepper's ghost), patent medicine and real estate\n- E5: spiritualist séances and rappings (`POLICY.md` decides their kind)\n- E6: hoax exposures and pranksters caught\n- E7: humour and joke columns\n- E8: phantom ships, trains and lights\n- E9: one story reprinted under different datelines\n- E10: badly garbled OCR\n- E11: segmentation errors, where several items are merged into one article\n- E12: non-English text\n- E13: \"Ghost\" as a surname or a place name\n- E14: political figures of speech (\"the ghost of the tariff\")\n\n## 8. Traceability\n| Requirements | Phase | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n1770.json\n1771.json\n1772.json\n1963.json\n1964.json\n     180\n1.5G\tdata/candidates\n563M\tdata/samples","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"dafb5af4-28b0-4cf3-b36a-488c340b782f","timestamp":"2026-10-31T06:45:01.286Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Model selection uses a dev split. The gold set is used only for these final runs.\n\n### 7.3 Edge-case suite\nEach slice uses at least 5 gold items where the archive has them:\n- E1: sermons and hymns about the Holy Ghost\n- E2: idioms (\"ghost of a chance\", \"gave up the ghost\", \"not the ghost of a\")\n- E3: ghost stories as fiction, serials and Christmas stories\n- E4: theatre and illusion adverts (Pepper's ghost), patent medicine and real estate\n- E5: spiritualist séances and rappings (`POLICY.md` decides their kind)\n- E6: hoax exposures and pranksters caught\n- E7: humour and joke columns\n- E8: phantom ships, trains and lights\n- E9: one story reprinted under different datelines\n- E10: badly garbled OCR\n- E11: segmentation errors, where several items are merged into one article\n- E12: non-English text\n- E13: \"Ghost\" as a surname or a place name\n- E14: political figures of speech (\"the ghost of the tariff\")\n\n## 8. Traceability\n| Requirements | Phase | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n1770.json\n1771.json\n1772.json\n1963.json\n1964.json\n     180\n1.5G\tdata/candidates\n563M\tdata/samples","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ea979982-155a-4add-94ec-cb28be589209","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2c-reader","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"564697f1-ddae-4ead-b5ea-85fd308dade5","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2c-reader","slug":"sunny-popping-comet"}
