{"parentUuid":"5d378175-c6f7-4cda-939b-1bf9285abc51","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgZtL8EWDPMLpkdLf1rRT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01K7F6RMdP732MHytMBmQg5P","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts\" && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nThe inclusive grouping and check_leakage.py (RDR-4), its threshold justified\n\nreprints.groups joins eval A's links through the opening's runs with links through the\nbody's, chained, as the EM's call B asks. Over every candidate and the near-miss\nreservoir it makes 108,967 groups of two or more, holding 474,805 articles; the largest\nholds 1,098.\n\ncheck_leakage.py also compares whole texts. A pool article reprints a gold or dev one\nwhen they share at least 5 of their five-word runs and at least 10% of the shorter's.\nOn decision 36's labelled pairs that flags all 603 one-story pairs of the randomly drawn\nstrata: the lowest share is 0.105 and the fewest runs 6\n(eval/results/phase2c/leakage_threshold.json).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q origin phase-2c-reader 2>&1 | grep -v -i -F \"$(hostname -s)\"; git log --oneline -1; git ls-remote origin refs/heads/phase-2c-reader","description":"Commit the grouping and leakage check, push, and verify"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1266,"cache_read_input_tokens":250711,"output_tokens":513,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1266,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":513,"cache_read_input_tokens":250711,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1266,"cache_cr